CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785259144
OL,3,CHome of the UK's largest telescope
OL,4,Cfaces uncertain future as funding is
OL,5,Ccut
OL,7,FThe Jodrell Bank Observatory, which
OL,8,Fhas housed the UK's largest telescope
OL,9,Ffor nearly 70 years, has lost its
OL,10,Ffunding leaving it facing an uncertain
OL,11,Ffuture.
OL,13,FThe deep-space observatory in Cheshire
OL,14,Fruns a world-leading network of radio
OL,15,Ftelescopes and hosts the Grade I-
OL,16,Flisted Lovell telescope.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
