OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785259144
OL,3,CHome of the UK's largest telescope
OL,4,Cfaces uncertain future as funding is
OL,5,Ccut
OL,7,FThe funding body, the UK Research and
OL,8,FInnovation (UKRI) agency, said it had
OL,9,Fto focus investment on the "greatest
OL,10,Flong-term scientific capability and
OL,11,Fvalue."
OL,13,FThe UKRI are withdrawing funding for
OL,14,F'e-Merlin' - the UK's national radio
OL,15,Fastronomy facility - which links seven
OL,16,Fradio telescopes, including Jodrell
OL,17,FBank across Great Britain when the
OL,18,Fcurrent arrangement ends in March 2028.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785259144
OL,3,CHome of the UK's largest telescope
OL,4,Cfaces uncertain future as funding is
OL,5,Ccut
OL,7,FThe site was first established in
OL,8,F1945, and its contribution to global
OL,9,Fscientific efforts earned it UNESCO
OL,10,FWorld Heritage status in 2019.
OL,12,FA spokesperson from UKRI said: "The
OL,13,FScience and Technology Facilities
OL,14,FCouncil (STFC) has undertaken a
OL,15,Frigorous prioritisation process to
OL,16,Ffocus investment on the areas that
OL,17,Fwill deliver the greatest long-term
OL,18,Fscientific capability, impact and
OL,19,Fvalue for the UK.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785259144
OL,3,CHome of the UK's largest telescope
OL,4,Cfaces uncertain future as funding is
OL,5,Ccut
OL,7,F"The decision to withdraw funding from
OL,8,Fe-MERLIN at the end of its current
OL,9,Ffunding agreement is the result of a
OL,10,Fcomprehensive, evidence-based
OL,11,Fprioritisation process.
OL,13,F"As part of this, STFC is focusing
OL,14,Finvestment on the areas that will
OL,15,Fdeliver the greatest long-term
OL,16,Fscientific capability and value,
OL,17,Fincluding the next generation of world-
OL,18,Fleading radio astronomy facilities.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785259144
OL,3,CHome of the UK's largest telescope
OL,4,Cfaces uncertain future as funding is
OL,5,Ccut
OL,7,F"STFC continues to invest in Jodrell
OL,8,FBank's future through its support for
OL,9,Fthe UK's hosting of the SKAO
OL,10,Fheadquarters, which is already
OL,11,Fdelivering significant benefits to the
OL,12,FUniversity of Manchester and the North
OL,13,FWest. The current e-MERLIN funding
OL,14,Fagreement runs until March 2028,
OL,15,Fproviding time to explore alternative
OL,16,Ffunding arrangements."
OL,18,FThe site is owned, managed and
OL,19,Foperated by the University of
OL,20,FManchester who have released a
OL,21,Fstatement saying:
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785259144
OL,3,CHome of the UK's largest telescope
OL,4,Cfaces uncertain future as funding is
OL,5,Ccut
OL,7,F"While these cuts to e-Merlin's
OL,8,Ffunding are significant, Jodrell Bank
OL,9,Fremains a major scientific, cultural
OL,10,Fand economic centre nationally and for
OL,11,Fthe local area.
OL,13,F"We will be looking at the
OL,14,Fimplications of this news carefully
OL,15,Fand working with our partners to
OL,16,Fsecure the future of the Lovell
OL,17,Ftelescope and e-Merlin."
OL,26,@oD@AOUyD@XO]
